  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Area Based Programme for the South-West State of Somalia - IP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to create conditions for change through the humanitarian-development-peace nexus using an area-based approach to reach communities to increase their resilience to conflict and climate crisis. It takes a holistic and an integrated approach to early recovery and development, using the Six Signature solutions and brings together all the results areas in the CO under one hat.</narrative>
  </description>
